*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : SHP0018
*> PURPOSE : SHIPPING CHARGES RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-08-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 538
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB SHPNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SHP0018.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY SHP0018C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==AC==.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 SHIP-BLOCK         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> DELIVERY SURCHARGE
    05 SURCHG-AMT         PIC 9(4)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 4000-HAZMAT
    DISPLAY "SHIP-BLOCK=" SHIP-BLOCK
    DISPLAY "SURCHG-AMT=" SURCHG-AMT
    STOP RUN.
4000-HAZMAT.
    IF AC-HAZMAT-FLAG = 'Y'
        *> NO OVERNIGHT HAZARDOUS GOODS
        IF SERVICE-OVERNIGHT
            MOVE 'Y' TO SHIP-BLOCK
        ELSE
            *> LONG-DISTANCE HAZARDOUS SURCHARGE
            IF AC-ROUTE-KM > 1000
                MOVE 60 TO SURCHG-AMT
            ELSE
                MOVE 25 TO SURCHG-AMT
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
